# a bond's countersignatures are marks whose who is the signer (world/bodies/bond.obend)
of: record
voice: terms in plain words and the hands that signed them; a story with better manners
form: <<END
parties: text 1..400
terms: text 1..400
amends: text 0..128
law: text 0..4096
END
text: law signer "a party signs only for themselves": changed(new.marks.who) by request.subject
body: bond
